# What the release workflow bakes into every artifact it builds. Not a
# secret: a reviewable, committed statement of which site a downloaded build
# talks to when the person configures nothing (docs/agentry/downloads.md on
# the site: "A binary downloaded from a registry's download page connects to
# that registry"). Before 1.0 the only site is dev, so releases are built for
# it; the launch flips this line to https://secureagentry.net (plan
# agentry-notes/plans/desktop-installers.md §6).
AGENTRY_DEFAULT_REGISTRY=https://dev.secureagentry.net
# Optional: the CN the Windows signature must carry (the name Artifact
# Signing validated). When set, scripts/check-windows-installer.sh --signed
# refuses a release signed by any other name; unset, the CN the certificate
# carries is recorded in BUILD-INFO and not asserted (agentry-desktop#54).
#AGENTRY_WINDOWS_SIGNING_CN=
